WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
Would you like a chocolate?

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.480
Oh, thank you.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.220
Forrest Gump

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.160
was in Savannah, Georgia,

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.500
a town with interesting history.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.260
But tour guides say,

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.980
The number one question I get is,

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.920
"Where's the bench in Forrest Gump?"

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.960
Michelle Freenor

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.520
offers walking tours.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:17.540
We are gonna do a

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.160
90 minute history tour of Savannah.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.660
She gets good reviews from customers.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.520
But her business

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.540
almost didn't get off the ground

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.220
because

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.560
Savannah's politicians say

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.800
to be a tour guide

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.620
you have to get a license.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.960
I had to pass a

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.900
college-level

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.631
history exam

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:35.740
with tons of

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.660
obscure gotcha questions.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.400
It could be

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.600
three to five months

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.100
of studying and studying it

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.080
because it was about

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.760
120 pages.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.820
I had to

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.500
map out

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.580
where I was standing,

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:47.880
what I was saying.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.800
Tour guides

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.740
need licenses?

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.780
In some cities

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:51.800
you have to have a license

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.520
just to tell stories.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.420
Dick Carpenter,

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.280
author of the book Bottleneckers

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.160
Gaming Government

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.280
for Power

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.340
and Private Profit

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.980
says Savannah's rules,

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.580
like those in many cities

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.080
create

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.080
so many hurdles

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:05.501
for entrepreneurs.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:06.860
Not only did Michelle

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:07.699
have to pass

00:01:07.699 --> 00:01:09.358
a difficult history test,

00:01:09.358 --> 00:01:11.635
she also had to do a criminal background check,

00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:13.154
which meant she had to give

00:01:13.154 --> 00:01:14.173
a urine sample

00:01:14.233 --> 00:01:15.372
and a blood sample.

00:01:15.372 --> 00:01:16.291
She also had to

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:18.329
go through a physical fitness test

00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:19.268
And then she had to pay

00:01:19.268 --> 00:01:20.667
fees to the city as a result.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:21.865
A hundred dollars

00:01:21.865 --> 00:01:22.804
and yet the test

00:01:22.804 --> 00:01:24.543
asked no questions about

00:01:24.563 --> 00:01:25.842
subjects covered

00:01:25.842 --> 00:01:27.660
by the most popular tours.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:29.558
You know the most popular tour

00:01:29.558 --> 00:01:30.217
in Savannah

00:01:30.217 --> 00:01:31.256
is a ghost tour.

00:01:31.256 --> 00:01:32.135
So she complained

00:01:32.135 --> 00:01:33.314
to a city official.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.500
There's no ghost questions on this test

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.080
and he goes

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.300
because ghosts aren't real.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.649
There were no questions about

00:01:38.649 --> 00:01:40.767
the making of Forrest Gump either.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.045
Stupid is as stupid does.

00:01:43.065 --> 00:01:44.324
Even if guides give

00:01:44.324 --> 00:01:45.462
Forrest Gump tours,

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:46.561
ghost tours,

00:01:46.561 --> 00:01:47.700
or food tours,

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.758
they had to take the test.

00:01:49.758 --> 00:01:51.576
The city was making a nice amount

00:01:51.576 --> 00:01:52.516
of money

00:01:52.516 --> 00:01:53.195
for

00:01:53.195 --> 00:01:54.554
people failing this.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.232
A lot of people think that this fee is just

00:01:56.232 --> 00:01:58.170
another money grab by the city.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.709
Alderman Bill Durrance says

00:01:59.709 --> 00:02:00.768
It's important

00:02:00.768 --> 00:02:02.480
to license tour guides.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.040
I hear a lot of tour guides

00:02:04.044 --> 00:02:06.502
saying things that make me cringe

00:02:06.502 --> 00:02:08.960
because it's just not accurate information

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:09.799
and so

00:02:09.799 --> 00:02:11.657
the licensing and the testing,

00:02:11.657 --> 00:02:12.936
I thought was a good idea

00:02:12.936 --> 00:02:14.794
just to make sure people had

00:02:14.794 --> 00:02:16.472
the accurate Information.

00:02:16.472 --> 00:02:17.192
Politicians

00:02:17.192 --> 00:02:19.270
in a bunch of other cities agree.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:20.129
They demand

00:02:20.129 --> 00:02:22.180
tour guides pass a test.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.040
The turning point for Michelle came

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.540
when she got sick.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.760
When I told them,

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:29.320
hey I don't think I could pass the physical this year,

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.300
I was actually told

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.400
by a city official,

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.620
"Well I guess you're gonna have to find

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.000
another occupation."

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.820
There were a couple of points

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:36.740
that maybe

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:37.792
went a little too far

00:02:37.792 --> 00:02:39.230
in the licensing process.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:41.040
Having to have the physical exam

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.520
periodically,

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.420
maybe the cost of the test.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.940
They basically said that if you don't like it

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.120
you can sue us

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.200
and when they said that,

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.940
that's what I did.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.240
With the help of the law firm

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.740
the Institute for Justice,

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:53.996
she sued Savannah

00:02:53.996 --> 00:02:54.995
and Savannah

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.460
removed its licensing rule.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:58.272
So how does that go down?

00:02:58.272 --> 00:02:59.410
You bring the suit

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.629
and they sheepishly say,

00:03:00.629 --> 00:03:01.508
oh yeah, you're right,

00:03:01.508 --> 00:03:03.440
it's a First Amendment issue?

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.140
Mmm I wish it were that easy.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.280
There's discovery,

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:08.320
depositions are taken

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.460
and so the city often

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.060
Months? Years?

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.499
Months,

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.740
often years.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:13.480
They realized

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.880
that this, was in fact,

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.334
a First Amendment issue

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.080
and they stood to lose.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.380
Savannah was just one of their victories.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.240
You want a Washington DC tour?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.600
Just ten dollars!

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.260
That's the Capital behind me.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.880
This is the IRS building.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.840
Oh I can't tell you that.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.420
That's

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:30.380
illegal.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.299
Washington DC

00:03:31.299 --> 00:03:32.219
once demanded

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.320
that guides have a license.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.540
So I joined this segway tour.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.020
Aren't they trying to make sure that

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.380
people get a proper tour?

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.200
We give them a proper tour.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.120
I mean,

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.260
I've passed a bar exam.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:43.680
I know how to give a proper tour.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:44.980
The Institute for Justice

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.260
sued Washington, too

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.140
and won.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.600
So now at least

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.800
in DC and Savannah,

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.800
tour guides are free to work.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.020
The free market

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.460
is taking care of itself.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.760
Bad tour companies

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.720
don't last.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.020
It's been a pleasure walking with you today.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.080
She's right.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.560
Competition protects

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.420
consumers

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.660
better than licensing laws

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.980
ever will.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:05.940
But politicians

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:06.900
always want

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.000
more control

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:08.760
over you.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.520
Little by little

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.840
we've managed to get control of some things

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:11.720
but we still

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.360
don't have control

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.300
over a lot.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.480
Yes you do.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.420
Your bottlenecks

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.580
are everywhere

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.160
So I'm glad

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.060
there are people out there

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.240
trying to stop them.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.140
In our next bottlenecker video,

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:23.800
we'll cover

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:24.720
the fight over

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.800
food trucks.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.240
I could have lost it all.

